@startuml agentic-autonomous-four-state-model
title Agentic/Autonomous Four-State Model ; per ADR-ES-022 section 5

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Conventional" as Conv
class "Agentic" as Ag
class "Autonomous" as Au
class "Agentic + Autonomous" as Both

Conv ..> Ag : Agentic dimension
Conv ..> Au : Autonomous dimension
Ag ..> Both : + Autonomous
Au ..> Both : + Agentic

note right
  Per ADR-ES-022 section 5:
  | Agentic | Autonomous | Characterization |
  | No      | No         | Conventional    |
  | Yes     | No         | Agentic         |
  | No      | Yes        | Autonomous      |
  | Yes     | Yes        | Agentic + Autonomous |

  Two independent semantic dimensions.
end note

@enduml
